stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed
    Closed --> Opening: Open tree or launcher
    Opening --> Tree: Tree arrival completes
    Opening --> Sky: Launcher arrival completes
    Tree --> Ascending: Top strip click / Ctrl+Up / search
    Ascending --> Sky: Camera arrives
    Sky --> Descending: Bottom-center click / Ctrl+Down
    Descending --> Tree: Camera arrives
    Tree --> Closed: Close / bare ground click / Escape
    Tree --> Closed: Settings node opens or focuses Settings
    Sky --> Closed: Close / Escape
    Ascending --> Closed: Escape
    Descending --> Closed: Escape
    Opening --> Closed: Escape
    note right of Tree
        Top target: at most 56 px and 10% height.
        Tree nodes and root actions take priority.
    end note
    note right of Sky
        Return target: at most 240 by 64 px,
        centered below search at the bottom edge.
        Hover reveals the arrow; click descends.
        Close remains in the upper-right corner.
    end note
    note left of Ascending
        Pointer navigation is disabled during travel.
        Set the incoming room flag before clearing the outgoing flag.
    end note
